  "releaseNotes": "Reduce client route-header, route-building and bound-call delegate allocations; materialize request-scoped MVC filters without a captured LINQ selector. Preserve filter order, DI scopes, contract refresh, cancellation, the 4.0.x wire format, authorization, audit and masking integrations. No universal end-to-end latency gain is claimed. See CHANGELOG.md.",
